# Butler Routes - Ironforge recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and schematics sold by vendors spawning
# inside Ironforge (zone 1455), verified against the local Forever game
# data. 46 recipes across 50 vendor links (see
# docs/city-recipes-inventory.md), including the Winter Veil seasonal pair
# and the commendation officer's manual. Each step is gated to its
# profession; the two patterns that name no profession anywhere in the data
# ship ungated with an honest note. No stock-class flag exists in the data,
# so nothing is marked limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ironforge-recipes
title Ironforge - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-60
zone Ironforge
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords ironforge, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

